              </Rung>
              <Rung Number="31" Type="N">
                <Comment>
<![CDATA[Optical Flasher Strobe Master Latch: 31-input OR gate evaluating one-shots System_Sound01 through 31. Upon rising edge of ANY process alarm, fire alarm, gas alarm, or level fault, latches optical strobe Tag_DO_15_INT.]]>
                </Comment>
                <Text>
<![CDATA[
                  [XIC(System_Sound01),XIC(System_Sound02),XIC(System_Sound08),XIC(System_Sound13),XIC(System_Sound18),XIC(System_Sound23),XIC(System_Sound03),XIC(System_Sound09),XIC(System_Sound14),XIC(System_Sound19),XIC(System_Sound24),XIC(System_Sound04),XIC(System_Sound10),XIC(System_Sound15),XIC(System_Sound20),XIC(System_Sound25),XIC(System_Sound05),XIC(System_Sound11),XIC(System_Sound16),XIC(System_Sound21),XIC(System_Sound26),XIC(System_Sound06),XIC(System_Sound12),XIC(System_Sound17),XIC(System_Sound22),XIC(System_Sound27),XIC(System_Sound07),XIC(System_Sound28),XIC(System_Sound29),XIC(System_Sound30),XIC(System_Sound31)]OTL(Tag_DO_15_INT);
                ]]>
                </Text>
              </Rung>
              <Rung Number="32" Type="N">
                <Comment>
<![CDATA[Acoustic Siren Master Latch: 26-input OR gate evaluating fire and gas alarm one-shots. Upon rising edge of ANY confirmed fire or gas hazard, latches main plant acoustic siren SA_7404_001_002_INT.]]>
                </Comment>
                <Text>
<![CDATA[
                  [XIC(System_Sound01),XIC(System_Sound02),XIC(System_Sound08),XIC(System_Sound13),XIC(System_Sound18),XIC(System_Sound23),XIC(System_Sound03),XIC(System_Sound09),XIC(System_Sound14),XIC(System_Sound19),XIC(System_Sound24),XIC(System_Sound04),XIC(System_Sound10),XIC(System_Sound15),XIC(System_Sound20),XIC(System_Sound25),XIC(System_Sound05),XIC(System_Sound11),XIC(System_Sound16),XIC(System_Sound21),XIC(System_Sound26),XIC(System_Sound06),XIC(System_Sound12),XIC(System_Sound17),XIC(System_Sound22),XIC(System_Sound07)]OTL(SA_7404_001_002_INT);
                ]]>
                </Text>
              </Rung>
              <Rung Number="33" Type="N">
                <Comment>
<![CDATA[Rising Edge Detection: CPU Battery / Memory Failure (SYS_BAD_RAM) -> One-shot System_Sound32.]]>
                </Comment>
                <Text>
