              <Rung Number="42" Type="N">
                <Comment>
<![CDATA[Acoustic Siren Silence / Unlatch: Unlatches main plant siren SA_7404_001_002_INT when master System_Reset is pressed or when Alarm Mute (System_Mute) is activated by operator.]]>
                </Comment>
