              <Rung Number="1" Type="N">
                <Comment>
<![CDATA[Pump B Start Pulse Output Interlock: Passes Pump_B_Start_PulsOut_INT to physical output Pump_B_Start_PulsOut (TB-08: 11-12).]]>
                </Comment>
                <Text>
<![CDATA[
                  XIC(Pump_B_Start_PulsOut_INT)OTE(Pump_B_Start_PulsOut);
                ]]>
                </Text>
              </Rung>
            </RLLContent>
          </Routine>
          <Routine Name="Modbus_Comm" Type="RLL">
            <Description>
<![CDATA[Subroutine: Modbus_Comm (Murphy Diesel Pump RS485 Modbus RTU Interface)
Communicates with Clarke / Murphy diesel fire pump engine panels via ProSoft MVI56E-MCM (Slot 9). Monitors engine speed (RPM), lube oil pressure, water temperature, alarm codes, and generates common process alarm PA-001.]]>
            </Description>
            <RLLContent>
              <Rung Number="0" Type="N">
                <Comment>
<![CDATA[Subroutine Header: Modbus RTU serial interface via ProSoft MVI56E-MCM module (Slot 9). Communicates over RS485 with Clarke / Murphy diesel fire pump engine panels and process pumps. MCM_IN array receives holding registers via module backplane M-file transfer.]]>
                </Comment>
                <Text>
<![CDATA[
                  NOP();
                ]]>
                </Text>
              </Rung>
              <Rung Number="1" Type="N">
                <Comment>
<![CDATA[Power Oil Pump P2300: Copies Modbus register MCM_IN[1] to alarm / shutdown code register MB_P2300_ALMCODE.]]>
                </Comment>
                <Text>
<![CDATA[
                  MOV(MCM_IN[1],MB_P2300_ALMCODE);
                ]]>
                </Text>
              </Rung>
              <Rung Number="2" Type="N">
                <Comment>
<![CDATA[Power Oil Pump P2300: Copies Modbus register MCM_IN[2] to engine running speed register MB_P2300_RPM.]]>
                </Comment>
                <Text>
<![CDATA[
                  MOV(MCM_IN[2],MB_P2300_RPM);
                ]]>
                </Text>
              </Rung>
              <Rung Number="3" Type="N">
                <Comment>
<![CDATA[Power Oil Pump P2300 Fault Evaluation: If alarm code NEQ 0, asserts P2300_SHUTDOWN.]]>
                </Comment>
                <Text>
<![CDATA[
                  NEQ(MB_P2300_ALMCODE,0)OTE(P2300_SHUTDOWN);
                ]]>
                </Text>
              </Rung>
              <Rung Number="4" Type="N">
                <Comment>
<![CDATA[Power Oil Pump P2400: Copies Modbus register MCM_IN[11] to alarm / shutdown code register MB_P2400_ALMCODE.]]>
                </Comment>
                <Text>
