<![CDATA[Subroutine: IO_Mapping_In (Physical Slot Input Buffer Table)
Isolates physical backplane hardware from internal application logic. Buffers Slot 7 1756-IB32 discrete inputs, Slots 2-5 1756-IF16 analog inputs, and Slot 6 1756-IF8H HART input into program tags.]]>
