                <Comment>
<![CDATA[DO Slot 8 Point 8 <- P2100_P2200 (Fail-Safe Active-Low): Oil Booster Pumps Feeder EDB1 Shunt Trip (TB-08: 17-18). Normally energized (1); de-energizes (0) on emergency shutdown.]]>
                </Comment>
                <Text>
